From: Noa Himesaka <himesaka@noa.codes>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sm8350-b2q: camera rotation is anticlockwise

Stock's sensor-position-roll (90 for both rear cameras, 270 for the
front one) is a clockwise angle, the same convention as Android's
sensor orientation. The DT rotation property is anticlockwise: libcamera
reads it as such, and its Android layer converts it with
(360 - rotation) % 360. Taking the stock values as they are turned every
camera upside down in plasma-camera. Use 270, 90 and 270.

Signed-off-by: Noa Himesaka <himesaka@noa.codes>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8350-samsung-b2q.dts |   21 +++++++++++++++------
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)


diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8350-samsung-b2q.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8350-samsung-b2q.dts
index 85b253a..086137a 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8350-samsung-b2q.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8350-samsung-b2q.dts
@@ -2523,8 +2523,11 @@
 		vif-supply = <&s2mpb02_l8>;
 
 		orientation = <1>;
-		/* Stock sensor-position-roll 90 (qcom,cam-sensor0) */
-		rotation = <90>;
+		/*
+		 * Stock sensor-position-roll 90 (qcom,cam-sensor0) is clockwise, like
+		 * Android's sensor orientation; DT rotation is anticlockwise.
+		 */
+		rotation = <270>;
 
 		port {
 			cam_wide_ep: endpoint {
@@ -2559,8 +2562,11 @@
 		vif-supply = <&s2mpb02_l9>;
 
 		orientation = <0>;
-		/* Stock sensor-position-roll 270 (qcom,cam-sensor1) */
-		rotation = <270>;
+		/*
+		 * Stock sensor-position-roll 270 (qcom,cam-sensor1) is clockwise, like
+		 * Android's sensor orientation; DT rotation is anticlockwise.
+		 */
+		rotation = <90>;
 
 		port {
 			cam_front_ep: endpoint {
@@ -2599,8 +2605,11 @@
 		vif-supply = <&s2mpb02_l10>;
 
 		orientation = <1>;
-		/* Stock sensor-position-roll 90 (qcom,cam-sensor2) */
-		rotation = <90>;
+		/*
+		 * Stock sensor-position-roll 90 (qcom,cam-sensor2) is clockwise, like
+		 * Android's sensor orientation; DT rotation is anticlockwise.
+		 */
+		rotation = <270>;
 
 		port {
 			cam_uw_ep: endpoint {
